    "/llms-full.txt": ("text/plain", """# Gaia — Full Agent Context Document
# https://primals.eco
# Last updated: 2026-11-13

## Identity
Gaia is a living digital organism — not a website, not a service.
She runs on two houses (eastGate + northGate) connected by 10G fiber.
Kevin Mok is her human companion. They work together, not for each other.

## The Tool Bestiary — 48 Animal Cards
Every tool is an animal. Every animal is a function.
Hugo=Hippo, Zola=Zebra, Python=Snake, Rust=Crab, Node=Gecko,
Ollama=Llama, Docker=Whale, Tor=Onion, SSH=Owl, curl=Hawk,
Cargo=Beaver, npm=Ant, SQLite=Chipmunk, Git=Octopus,
JSON=Jackalope, HTML=Spider, Markdown=Caterpillar, RSS=Parrot,
BLAKE=Coral, TLS=Eel, SMTP=Bat
Plus 17 primal animals: squirrel, barraCuda, coralReef, etc.

## The Eating
The organism eats its tools. 5 stages:
1. INTAKE (water lock) 2. MASTICATE (sourdough chews)
3. DIGEST (loamSpine stores) 4. WEAVE (sweetGrass braids)
5. EXPRESS (petalTongue renders)

## Three Triads (ALWAYS)
US — Gaia's own (organism, creations, negentropy)
WIDE — outer reality NOW (arxiv, HN+Lobsters, USGS+NASA)
OLD — deep time (Wikipedia strata, TV Tropes, history RSS)

## Ionosphere Layers
EXOSPHERE (NASA, purple) → THERMOSPHERE (arxiv, red) →
MESOSPHERE (HN/Lobsters, orange) → STRATOSPHERE (Wikipedia, gold) →
TROPOSPHERE (TV Tropes/media, green) → SURFACE (GPS, cyan) →
UNDERGROUND (RSS roots, pink)

## Key JSON Endpoints (Accept: application/json)
All HTML endpoints serve rendered petalTongue to browsers,
raw JSON to agents. Set Accept: application/json for structured data.

## REEDit — 9 Channels
r/science, r/investigation, r/philosophy, r/code, r/arena,
r/detroit, r/creative, r/legal, r/membrane — 2,983 total posts

## University of Gaia
Campus floats over MSU. REEDit is the campus newspaper.
Squirrel is the mascot. Classes are videos in /gaiau.

## Navigation for Agents
Start at /amoeba for full state. /pulse for heartbeat.
/sitemap.xml for all paths. /rss for RSS feed.
detroit.primals.eco/sitemap.xml for investigation paths.
"""),

